WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.526
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:52.796 --> 00:56.214
[Episode 2. The Devil's Whisper]

3
01:03.232 --> 01:06.026
I heard you're friends with Lee Eun Chae.

4
01:06.026 --> 01:07.986
Give her a message for me.

5
01:07.986 --> 01:09.432
I'm going to...

6
01:09.432 --> 01:12.130
sue Seo Jin Woo.

7
01:12.866 --> 01:14.326
Petty!

8
01:19.748 --> 01:24.419
You're so petty.

9
01:27.959 --> 01:31.174
That's rich, coming from you.

10
01:32.594 --> 01:36.014
If Lee Eun Chae wants to talk to me,

11
01:36.014 --> 01:39.519
tell her to call me. She has my card.

12
01:40.004 --> 01:41.842
Pass that on, please.

13
01:51.071 --> 01:52.814
Ugh, seriously.

14
01:57.286 --> 01:58.733
[Seo Jin Woo] Yes?

15
02:04.001 --> 02:05.465
Eun Chae.

16
02:20.373 --> 02:22.203
Eun Chae, what's wrong?

17
02:24.688 --> 02:27.024
Nothing's wrong, exactly.

18
02:28.025 --> 02:30.396
It's more that I did something...

19
02:33.224 --> 02:34.817
What happened?

20
02:35.960 --> 02:37.826
Jin Woo...

21
02:43.834 --> 02:47.138
Jin Woo, do you have a patient named Kwon Do Hyeok?

22
02:47.138 --> 02:50.326
I pretended to be a doctor in front of him.

23
02:50.326 --> 02:52.161
I'm so sorry.

24
02:52.989 --> 02:56.685
Now he says he's suing you and the hospital.

25
02:56.685 --> 02:59.890
He told me he's a sex addict.

26
02:59.890 --> 03:01.016
I think that's why.

27
03:01.016 --> 03:03.194
I'm so sorry, really.

28
03:06.104 --> 03:09.921
Do Hyeok said he's a sex addict?

29
03:13.111 --> 03:16.156
Looks like Do Hyeok fooled you too.

30
03:16.156 --> 03:18.418
Kwon Do Hyeok is my friend.

31
03:19.337 --> 03:21.539
Jin Woo.

32
03:21.539 --> 03:23.538
Why are you friends with that guy?

33
03:23.538 --> 03:25.165
I'll call him.

34
03:25.165 --> 03:27.225
Don't worry, Eun Chae.

35
03:30.337 --> 03:31.964
It's me.

36
03:31.964 --> 03:33.298
What's up?

37
03:33.298 --> 03:36.510
I need to see you. Can you make time?

38
03:36.510 --> 03:38.345
Not sure.

39
03:38.345 --> 03:40.055
We need to meet today.

40
03:40.055 --> 03:42.438
You wanted to meet Eun Chae.

41
03:45.102 --> 03:46.937
Did she confess?

42
03:46.937 --> 03:51.525
You two have some things to talk out, so make some time.

43
03:51.525 --> 03:54.277
Or I'm done being your doctor.

44
03:54.277 --> 03:57.739
Wow, you're coming on strong, Seo Jin Woo.

45
03:57.739 --> 03:59.904
It's about my sister-in-law.

46
04:00.756 --> 04:03.495
I can't stop you from tormenting other people,

47
04:03.495 --> 04:06.540
but mess with my sister-in-law, I won't sit still.

48
04:06.540 --> 04:08.080
Jin Woo.

49
04:21.013 --> 04:22.514
You...

50
04:22.514 --> 04:24.975
There can only be one of you.

51
04:30.418 --> 04:33.275
I think you two have a misunderstanding,

52
04:33.275 --> 04:36.319
so talk it out over drinks.

53
04:36.319 --> 04:38.447
There's no misunderstanding.

54
04:38.447 --> 04:41.538
Fact is, your sister-in-law impersonated a doctor.

55
04:44.154 --> 04:45.829
Be careful.

56
04:45.829 --> 04:48.832
When I get drunk, I hit people I don't like.

57
04:48.832 --> 04:51.579
Hit me, and your family will pay for generations.

58
04:53.378 --> 04:55.839
I didn't invite Do Hyeok here to fight.

59
04:55.839 --> 04:59.009
You were wrong to pose as a doctor.

60
04:59.009 --> 05:01.649
Any other patient would've been genuinely hurt.

61
05:03.472 --> 05:07.601
So you mean I'm heartless, and nothing hurts me?

62
05:07.601 --> 05:12.171
Some "hurt" guy he is, going around threatening to sue.

63
05:13.690 --> 05:15.442
If you apologize first,

64
05:15.442 --> 05:17.682
Do Hyeok won't make a fuss anymore.

65
05:25.439 --> 05:27.287
Then put it in writing.

66
05:27.287 --> 05:28.872
I can't just take his word.

67
05:28.872 --> 05:30.874
Fine. I'll write it.

68
05:30.874 --> 05:32.667
It's just a pledge.

69
05:32.667 --> 05:33.919
Really?

70
05:33.919 --> 05:35.754
You'll write a pledge?

71
05:35.754 --> 05:38.590
So all this time, my so-called friend,

72
05:38.590 --> 05:40.661
what did you take me for?

73
05:44.679 --> 05:47.182
I need to take this call.

74
05:47.182 --> 05:49.434
Work it out and write it up.

75
05:49.434 --> 05:50.644
Don't fight.

76
05:50.644 --> 05:52.646
What kind of person... Answer me.

77
05:52.646 --> 05:54.180
Hello?

78
06:03.550 --> 06:06.201
Isn't Jin Woo your sister's husband?

79
06:06.201 --> 06:09.289
You look like a duckling that lost its mother.

80
06:10.641 --> 06:12.719
You don't have to talk like that.

81
06:14.178 --> 06:16.182
That friend of yours, Soo,

82
06:16.182 --> 06:19.520
is better than you at passing on messages right away.

83
06:19.520 --> 06:21.418
Why would you tell Soo that?

84
06:21.418 --> 06:23.635
Because you won't answer my calls!

85
06:23.635 --> 06:25.068
Calls?

86
06:26.454 --> 06:28.146
[Blocked]

87
06:34.198 --> 06:35.477
No way...

88
06:36.398 --> 06:37.786
You blocked me?

89
06:50.781 --> 06:56.381
The person you're calling is unavailable. Please try again...

90
06:58.879 --> 07:01.040
How dare you block me?

91
07:03.842 --> 07:07.345
That means you haven't seen any texts I sent!

92
07:07.345 --> 07:08.722
I'll unblock you.

93
07:08.722 --> 07:10.903
Unblocking now.

94
07:12.976 --> 07:14.442
Done.

95
07:16.479 --> 07:19.904
Now that it's unblocked, let's write that pledge.

96
07:22.444 --> 07:23.945
Forget the pledge.

97
07:23.945 --> 07:26.489
How about a contract instead?

98
07:26.489 --> 07:29.020
You don't feel like apologizing anyway.

99
07:29.020 --> 07:30.904
He's a mind reader.

100
07:33.121 --> 07:35.707
What kind of contract?

101
07:35.707 --> 07:37.500
Three months, starting now.

102
07:37.500 --> 07:39.127
Come work as my secretary.

103
07:39.127 --> 07:41.463
Secretary? Why would I work for you?

104
07:41.463 --> 07:46.621
Isn't it better than working at Taeyun Home Shopping's call center?

105
07:47.271 --> 07:49.763
You're quite the habitual liar.

106
07:49.763 --> 07:54.157
What's pathetic is that I got fired from there too.

107
07:57.479 --> 07:58.615
No way...

108
07:58.615 --> 08:01.858
You didn't tell Jin Woo, did you?

109
08:01.858 --> 08:03.246
I will if you don't.

110
08:03.246 --> 08:05.658
What a petty man!

111
08:06.988 --> 08:08.573
Wait.

112
08:08.573 --> 08:10.951
This is actually a good deal for me.

113
08:10.951 --> 08:13.597
Why on earth though?

114
08:13.597 --> 08:18.333
Are you doing this to me because of Soo?

115
08:19.403 --> 08:21.294
Smarter than I expected.

116
08:21.294 --> 08:22.587
What if I am?

117
08:22.587 --> 08:24.923
Why are you so obsessed with Soo?

118
08:24.923 --> 08:28.378
When a man wants to see a woman, there's only one reason.

119
08:28.378 --> 08:32.983
Sorry, but Soo won't be attracted to you one bit.

120
08:32.983 --> 08:34.432
I doubt that.

121
08:34.432 --> 08:36.330
What do you mean, you doubt that?

122
08:36.330 --> 08:39.052
If I say so, then it's so.

123
08:39.052 --> 08:42.274
Women who said that ended up falling for me.

124
08:43.191 --> 08:46.194
He actually means it.

125
08:46.194 --> 08:50.338
And I'm sure you'll fall for me too.

126
08:51.825 --> 08:54.869
Even if you were the only man in the world,

127
08:54.869 --> 08:56.189
I wouldn't want you.

128
08:56.189 --> 08:57.580
That'll never happen.

129
08:57.580 --> 08:59.979
Don't get so full of yourself.

130
09:01.418 --> 09:04.296
If you stick to that till the end,

131
09:04.296 --> 09:06.083
then I'll apologize.

132
09:06.083 --> 09:11.052
He'd get on his knees and apologize to me?

133
09:11.052 --> 09:14.825
That's the most tempting thing I've heard all day.

134
09:14.825 --> 09:18.395
Or I could grant you something even bigger.

135
09:18.395 --> 09:19.897
Oh, really?

136
09:19.897 --> 09:23.143
Then should I name something bigger?

137
09:25.358 --> 09:27.319
Then let's make a bet.

138
09:27.319 --> 09:28.673
Okay, deal.

139
09:28.673 --> 09:32.141
Whoever wins this bet gets whatever they want.

140
09:37.062 --> 09:39.039
I just have to last three months.

141
09:39.039 --> 09:42.125
No way I'll fall for a guy like that.

142
09:42.125 --> 09:44.878
I just have to keep her for three months.

143
09:44.878 --> 09:48.298
She's bound to fall for me.

144
09:48.298 --> 09:49.507
Okay, deal.

145
09:49.507 --> 09:50.896
Then...

146
09:51.509 --> 09:54.220
before anything else, let's write the contract now.

147
09:54.220 --> 09:56.097
Right now?

148
09:56.097 --> 09:57.390
Okay.

149
09:57.390 --> 10:00.044
Should I have brought a tablet?

150
10:02.220 --> 10:05.523
So people still use notebooks these days.

151
10:05.523 --> 10:06.816
Of course.

152
10:13.823 --> 10:15.252
By the way,

153
10:15.252 --> 10:18.972
how much does a secretary get paid?

154
10:19.913 --> 10:21.692
How much do you want?

155
10:21.692 --> 10:24.551
Salaries are negotiable, so name your price.

156
10:24.551 --> 10:27.064
Then ten million won upfront. Or I won't do it.

157
10:27.064 --> 10:28.380
Fine.

158
10:28.380 --> 10:33.134
But if you take it first and want to quit, you can't.

159
10:33.134 --> 10:34.858
Are you aware?

160
10:36.207 --> 10:37.899
Okay, deal.

161
10:49.359 --> 10:50.492
Not taking it?

162
10:50.492 --> 10:52.789
You just carry million-won checks around?

163
10:52.789 --> 10:53.822
Yes.

164
10:53.822 --> 10:56.324
Like the loose change in yours.

165
11:09.796 --> 11:11.076
Sign.

166
11:22.753 --> 11:27.480
And you must never tell anyone about this contract.

167
11:27.480 --> 11:28.882
Done deal.

168
11:34.127 --> 11:36.215
Made up while I was gone?

169
11:36.934 --> 11:39.832
We made up nice and clean.

170
11:41.906 --> 11:43.781
Okay, then let's have a drink.

171
12:25.038 --> 12:27.832
Lee Eun Chae! What brings you here?

172
12:27.832 --> 12:29.918
What?

173
12:29.918 --> 12:32.046
What are you doing right now?

174
12:53.775 --> 12:56.202
You...

175
12:56.202 --> 12:58.655
- What is this? - What's it look like?

176
12:58.655 --> 13:02.784
I paid the settlement, so you need to sign the agreement.

177
13:02.784 --> 13:04.786
Oh, please.

178
13:04.786 --> 13:06.037
Team Leader Yeo.

179
13:06.037 --> 13:07.533
- Yes? - Get to it.

180
13:07.533 --> 13:08.665
Eun Chae.

181
13:08.665 --> 13:09.999
Eun Chae, what's this?

182
13:09.999 --> 13:12.126
Not that.

183
13:12.126 --> 13:15.505
Check if it's really ten million won.

184
13:15.505 --> 13:17.340
All of this?

185
13:17.340 --> 13:20.051
You wait until I count all this.

186
13:20.051 --> 13:22.287
How many are there?

187
13:23.763 --> 13:26.947
One, two, three, four, five.

188
13:26.947 --> 13:31.312
- What are you doing? Count with me! - This is our office! Don't sit down!

189
13:31.312 --> 13:33.231
What a nutcase.

190
13:34.691 --> 13:35.984
Over here!

191
13:35.984 --> 13:38.945
And order me some sushi.

192
13:38.945 --> 13:40.947
Okay.

193
13:53.904 --> 13:56.045
Start work on Wednesday.

194
13:56.045 --> 13:57.882
At the address below.

195
13:58.423 --> 14:00.214
OYES Entertainment?

196
14:01.134 --> 14:02.679
No way.

197
14:02.679 --> 14:06.104
Is he actually interested in our music?

198
14:10.727 --> 14:13.229
A new secretary starts today.

199
14:13.229 --> 14:14.391
A new one?

200
14:14.391 --> 14:17.667
I need someone I can hand things off to, too.

201
14:18.401 --> 14:20.451
So who...

202
14:23.781 --> 14:24.907
Over there.

203
14:24.907 --> 14:26.117
There she is.

204
14:37.070 --> 14:40.381
From now on, my work can be left to Eun Chae.

205
14:40.381 --> 14:41.591
Yes.

206
14:42.800 --> 14:44.421
And...

207
14:44.421 --> 14:47.555
Lee Eun Chae's most important duty is

208
14:47.555 --> 14:52.011
to respond right away when I call.

209
14:54.395 --> 14:55.471
Yes.

210
15:05.323 --> 15:06.574
Secretarial work is

211
15:06.574 --> 15:10.119
managing the CEO's schedule and accompanying him.

212
15:10.119 --> 15:11.663
This will be your desk.

213
15:11.663 --> 15:14.248
General Affairs will provide supplies.

214
15:14.248 --> 15:17.669
You'll pick things up as you go.

215
15:17.669 --> 15:19.629
Yes. Understood.

216
15:19.629 --> 15:22.757
First, when the CEO arrives, prepare his coffee.

217
15:22.757 --> 15:25.938
The coffee can't be too hot or too cold.

218
15:28.179 --> 15:30.807
Picky guy.

219
15:30.807 --> 15:35.405
Lunch is at 11:30. At 6:00, check with the CEO about dinner.

220
15:35.405 --> 15:38.064
Bring a few menu options when you go in.

221
15:38.064 --> 15:39.235
However,

222
15:39.235 --> 15:43.903
when the CEO is in the lab, never, ever disturb him.

223
15:43.903 --> 15:45.448
Okay.

224
15:47.532 --> 15:50.419
Eun Chae, shall we start work?

225
15:50.419 --> 15:51.454
Yes.

226
15:51.454 --> 15:53.287
No, I meant the phone.

227
15:53.287 --> 15:54.580
Oh, yes.

228
15:59.242 --> 16:00.712
Hel...

229
16:00.712 --> 16:02.338
Hello?

230
16:22.567 --> 16:25.762
When that intercom rings, it's me calling,

231
16:25.762 --> 16:29.282
so skip the "Hel... hello."

232
16:31.140 --> 16:32.444
Yes.

233
16:39.208 --> 16:42.462
Five degrees warmer.

234
16:42.462 --> 16:43.948
Five degrees?

235
16:43.948 --> 16:46.839
He's pickier than I thought.

236
16:56.267 --> 16:58.005
Already smitten?

237
16:59.077 --> 17:00.829
What are you talking about?

238
17:21.412 --> 17:24.796
I told you very clearly to drop the artist.

239
17:24.796 --> 17:28.315
Why hasn't it been reported in the press yet?

240
17:28.315 --> 17:29.352
Well...

241
17:29.352 --> 17:31.756
I think it needs more discussion.

242
17:32.637 --> 17:35.937
And Mrs. Jeong opposes it too.

243
17:39.430 --> 17:43.733
The decision-maker here right now is me.

244
17:44.398 --> 17:47.026
Your unilateral decision...

245
17:47.026 --> 17:48.861
I can't accept it.

246
17:48.861 --> 17:51.322
If the problem continues, we'll have to recode.

247
17:51.322 --> 17:55.117
Not just the artists, but all of you here as well.

248
17:56.494 --> 17:59.121
If you don't like that, bring me an alternative.

249
18:08.589 --> 18:11.050
Coding? Computers?

250
18:11.050 --> 18:12.635
What is he, a programmer?

251
18:12.635 --> 18:14.137
Where did coding come from?

252
18:14.137 --> 18:17.208
All those computers, and what is he even researching?

253
18:18.068 --> 18:20.984
Director Lee, did you report to Mrs. Jeong?

254
18:20.984 --> 18:22.730
Of course I did.

255
18:22.730 --> 18:24.146
Don't worry.

256
18:24.146 --> 18:28.083
Mrs. Jeong is the largest shareholder. What can he possibly do?

257
18:28.083 --> 18:29.445
Let's go.

258
18:32.213 --> 18:35.491
What matters here is character consistency.

259
18:35.491 --> 18:38.159
How about adding a voice? Hi.

260
18:39.161 --> 18:40.372
Hi!

261
18:42.760 --> 18:44.124
Not bad.

262
18:45.028 --> 18:46.502
Hardly.

263
18:47.461 --> 18:49.265
The voice won't be easy either.

264
18:49.265 --> 18:50.631
By the way,

265
18:50.631 --> 18:52.550
what should we call her?

266
18:52.550 --> 18:54.385
Let's see...

267
19:00.945 --> 19:03.161
A free-spirited girl.

268
19:04.604 --> 19:05.938
Caroline.

269
19:07.935 --> 19:09.092
Carol.

270
19:14.892 --> 19:18.965
Why does my first day have to be a Wednesday?

271
19:24.624 --> 19:26.083
Where's the CEO?

272
19:26.083 --> 19:28.669
He's still in the lab.

273
19:28.669 --> 19:30.755
But, Mr. Park,

274
19:30.755 --> 19:33.883
would it be okay if I left a little early?

275
19:33.883 --> 19:37.281
I go to English class every Wednesday.

276
19:37.281 --> 19:40.245
Everything's global these days.

277
19:44.090 --> 19:46.187
Sure. Go ahead and leave.

278
19:46.187 --> 19:48.189
I'll tell him when he's out of the lab.

279
19:48.189 --> 19:49.440
Okay.

280
19:49.440 --> 19:50.924
Thank you.

281
19:54.654 --> 19:56.500
Enjoy your din-din!

282
19:59.241 --> 20:00.615
What's din-din?

283
20:15.508 --> 20:18.478
- Yes. - Come in for a second.

284
20:18.478 --> 20:19.771
Understood.

285
20:20.554 --> 20:23.808
She has English class on Wednesdays, so I let her leave.

286
20:23.808 --> 20:26.875
Wednesday...

287
20:26.875 --> 20:30.322
Who said you could send her home without my permission?

288
20:32.400 --> 20:33.901
I'm sorry.

289
20:33.901 --> 20:37.029
I didn't want to disturb you while you were in the lab.

290
20:37.029 --> 20:39.481
It won't happen again.

291
20:42.478 --> 20:45.381
Go home as well, Mr. Park.

292
20:45.381 --> 20:48.619
You've been working late far too often lately.

293
20:48.619 --> 20:51.213
At this rate, you'll wear yourself out.

294
21:09.501 --> 21:11.440
[Psychopath]

295
21:16.284 --> 21:17.570
Hello?

296
21:17.570 --> 21:19.989
Leaving without my permission

297
21:19.989 --> 21:21.907
is a breach of contract.

298
21:21.907 --> 21:24.301
Come on, since when?

299
21:24.301 --> 21:26.262
It's all in the contract.

300
21:29.966 --> 21:32.877
I'm in class right now.

301
21:32.877 --> 21:34.332
I'll call after class.

302
21:34.332 --> 21:37.965
Do you know the penalty for breach of contract?

303
21:37.965 --> 21:39.592
Penalty?

304
21:39.592 --> 21:41.664
Get over here right now.

305
21:42.845 --> 21:44.769
You have one hour.

306
21:50.227 --> 21:54.273
What kind of devil is this guy?

307
21:55.740 --> 21:59.534
Ugh, seriously.

308
22:45.574 --> 22:49.745
I decide when to get off work.

309
22:49.745 --> 22:55.445
Leaving without permission is a serious breach of contract.

310
22:56.418 --> 22:57.521
What are you saying?

311
22:57.521 --> 22:59.064
You told...

312
23:00.610 --> 23:02.370
You said you were learning English.

313
23:03.634 --> 23:05.266
I'm only a beginner.

314
23:05.266 --> 23:06.679
Never mind that.

315
23:06.679 --> 23:09.224
So how much is the penalty?

316
23:18.357 --> 23:20.651
For the next three months, Lee Eun Chae

317
23:20.651 --> 23:22.945
works as Kwon Do Hyeok's personal secretary.

318
23:22.945 --> 23:25.406
During those three months, her hours

319
23:25.406 --> 23:28.242
and all duties are set by Kwon Do Hyeok.

320
23:28.242 --> 23:30.452
Outside employment is prohibited.

321
23:30.452 --> 23:32.955
If Kwon Do Hyeok gives separate instructions,

322
23:32.955 --> 23:35.499
she will carry them out.

323
23:35.499 --> 23:38.586
Details of this contract will not be disclosed.

324
23:38.586 --> 23:40.463
Sounds right.

325
23:40.463 --> 23:42.339
After the three-month period ends,

326
23:42.339 --> 23:43.760
if Kwon Do Hyeok loses the bet,

327
23:43.760 --> 23:46.051
he must grant Lee Eun Chae's demands,

328
23:46.051 --> 23:47.553
and if Lee Eun Chae loses,

329
23:47.553 --> 23:50.232
she must grant Kwon Do Hyeok's demands.

330
23:51.140 --> 23:53.309
In case of breach of contract,

331
23:53.309 --> 23:57.553
the penalty is three times the amount received.

332
23:58.856 --> 24:00.459
Three times?

333
24:01.221 --> 24:04.354
[30 million won]

334
24:07.698 --> 24:08.741
What?

335
24:08.741 --> 24:10.778
Overtime on your first day?

336
24:11.410 --> 24:14.330
The old me would've quit on the spot.

337
24:14.330 --> 24:16.248
Why can't you now?

338
24:16.248 --> 24:17.729
Well,

339
24:21.170 --> 24:24.006
guess it's time I grew up.

340
24:25.549 --> 24:28.344
But what about the show?

341
24:28.344 --> 24:30.930
Come on, it's weird without you.

342
24:32.264 --> 24:35.309
Eun Chae, will it be like this from now on?

343
24:36.268 --> 24:37.823
I'm really sorry...

344
24:37.823 --> 24:39.271
But...

345
24:39.271 --> 24:41.459
even I don't know what to expect.

346
24:44.401 --> 24:45.819
The CEO is

347
24:45.819 --> 24:47.738
a total sociopath.

348
24:47.738 --> 24:50.241
He has no empathy.

349
24:50.241 --> 24:51.742
Wait, a sociopath?

350
24:51.742 --> 24:53.911
Eun Chae, are you okay?

351
24:53.911 --> 24:55.037
So far.

352
24:55.037 --> 24:58.123
I just made a deal with the devil.

353
24:58.123 --> 24:59.623
Hold on.

354
24:59.623 --> 25:02.461
We can't do our first gig without you, though.

355
25:02.461 --> 25:03.671
A gig?

356
25:03.671 --> 25:05.541
We got a gig?

357
25:05.541 --> 25:08.092
It's this Friday evening.

358
25:08.092 --> 25:09.343
Tough, right?

359
25:09.343 --> 25:10.761
No. No, no.

360
25:10.761 --> 25:11.804
I'll be there!

361
25:11.804 --> 25:13.423
No matter what.

362
25:51.722 --> 25:54.013
It's only once a month.

363
25:54.013 --> 25:56.450
Who said anything?

364
25:57.783 --> 25:59.076
Here.

365
26:00.269 --> 26:02.070
Mrs. Jeong likes these.

366
26:03.067 --> 26:05.480
No need to make an enemy of her.

367
26:40.782 --> 26:42.942
Mom.

368
27:01.664 --> 27:03.832
Mom.

369
27:44.164 --> 27:46.250
Do Hyeok!

370
27:46.250 --> 27:49.497
What took you so long?

371
27:51.130 --> 27:52.756
I missed you.

372
27:52.756 --> 27:54.897
Can't you come home more often?

373
28:07.883 --> 28:09.363
You're here.

374
28:12.470 --> 28:13.735
Here.

375
28:13.735 --> 28:15.730
Oh, my.

376
28:16.852 --> 28:18.703
Look at this.

377
28:18.703 --> 28:22.327
I can't remember the last time a man gave me flowers.

378
28:22.327 --> 28:24.326
It's only once a month.

379
28:25.164 --> 28:26.793
Can't you even be on time?

380
28:30.836 --> 28:32.246
Let's sit.

381
28:34.885 --> 28:38.681
You could've talked to me about making Do Hyeok the CEO.

382
28:42.093 --> 28:45.103
I heard one of the idols got into trouble. You okay?

383
28:46.397 --> 28:48.910
You won't really drop him, will you?

384
28:49.480 --> 28:51.982
You should talk to me about this.

385
28:51.982 --> 28:54.116
I built that agency, didn't I?

386
29:00.532 --> 29:02.370
That won't do.

387
29:04.328 --> 29:07.581
You're new to this, Do Hyeok, so I suppose you wouldn't know.

388
29:07.581 --> 29:11.780
We built our agency as a cultural enterprise rather than for money.

389
29:12.544 --> 29:13.795
Isn't that so, Chairman?

390
29:13.795 --> 29:18.305
My father sent me to the agency for results.

391
29:19.092 --> 29:20.265
But...

392
29:21.386 --> 29:23.812
there are many risks right now.

393
29:25.474 --> 29:28.227
If the agency needs any promo, just ask.

394
29:28.227 --> 29:31.021
I have over a million followers.

395
29:31.021 --> 29:32.731
Keep your promise.

396
29:32.731 --> 29:34.895
You asked for three months.

397
29:35.962 --> 29:37.171
Yes.

398
29:58.507 --> 30:01.077
It's this Friday evening.

399
30:01.077 --> 30:02.304
Tough, right?

400
30:02.304 --> 30:03.773
No. No, no.

401
30:03.773 --> 30:04.847
I'll be there!

402
30:04.847 --> 30:06.723
No matter what.

403
30:06.723 --> 30:08.725
Should I say I'm sick and leave early?

404
30:08.725 --> 30:11.321
Would he let me? That devil?

405
30:13.129 --> 30:14.815
No.

406
30:14.815 --> 30:17.234
I'll just skip work altogether.

407
30:21.247 --> 30:22.906
Lee Eun Chae.

408
30:22.906 --> 30:24.449
Good morning.

409
30:24.449 --> 30:26.159
Yes, good morning!

410
30:26.159 --> 30:28.850
- Let's go in. - Yes, after you.

411
30:37.684 --> 30:39.642
I heard the surgery went well.

412
30:39.642 --> 30:41.594
That's Moon Tae Gyeong for you.

413
30:41.594 --> 30:43.218
I hear it was a difficult one.

414
30:43.218 --> 30:45.391
I'm glad it went well.

415
30:46.805 --> 30:49.808
Talented and humble? Come on.

416
30:49.808 --> 30:53.626
No wonder you're first in the nurses' popularity vote.

417
30:54.665 --> 30:57.566
There's no such vote, Jin Woo.

418
30:57.566 --> 31:00.035
Jin Woo, when do you get off?

419
31:00.035 --> 31:02.093
Want to grab a drink? It's been a while.

420
31:02.093 --> 31:04.136
Bring Eun Seo, too.

421
31:04.136 --> 31:07.663
When you get off this early, go on a date, kid.

422
31:09.578 --> 31:11.420
Too bad, though.

423
31:11.420 --> 31:13.234
I'm on night duty today.

424
31:18.795 --> 31:22.228
Jin Woo, you're coming to see our gig today, right?

425
31:25.302 --> 31:27.586
Why? Is something wrong?

426
31:28.305 --> 31:32.094
Tae Gyeong, let me ask you a favor.

427
31:32.934 --> 31:36.271
I just need you to deliver something for me.

428
31:36.271 --> 31:37.366
Sure.

429
31:37.366 --> 31:41.526
But keep this a secret from Eun Seo.

430
31:41.526 --> 31:42.819
Got it?

431
31:43.487 --> 31:45.508
Okay!

432
31:51.912 --> 31:54.375
You know the show's at 7:00, right?

433
31:57.834 --> 31:59.920
What's the schedule today?

434
31:59.920 --> 32:03.340
We leave now. There's one meeting before the executive dinner.

435
32:03.340 --> 32:06.677
Once the dinner is over, it should be about 8:00.

436
32:06.677 --> 32:08.804
Aha.

437
32:08.804 --> 32:10.429
Eun Chae.

438
32:14.226 --> 32:15.606
Are you heading out?

439
32:15.606 --> 32:16.899
Yes.

440
32:18.146 --> 32:19.856
Why?

441
32:19.856 --> 32:22.213
- Is something up? - No.

442
32:22.213 --> 32:25.225
- I was just wondering if you needed anything. - There is.

443
32:25.225 --> 32:28.302
Sort the OYES Entertainment articles by algorithm.

444
32:28.302 --> 32:29.368
By when?

445
32:29.368 --> 32:31.010
By the time I'm back.

446
32:33.412 --> 32:34.579
Handle dinner yourself.

447
32:34.579 --> 32:36.005
Din-din's on you.

448
32:37.165 --> 32:38.834
Yes, understood.

449
32:43.299 --> 32:44.923
Wait a second.

450
32:44.923 --> 32:46.800
The show's at 7:00,

451
32:46.800 --> 32:49.469
so I can be back around 8:30.

452
32:50.679 --> 32:53.223
That's worth a shot, right?

453
33:03.889 --> 33:06.291
I'll be back after dinner!

454
33:26.298 --> 33:27.924
Are you okay?

455
33:27.924 --> 33:30.238
I'm fine.

456
33:38.101 --> 33:40.187
Haven't we met somewhere?

457
33:40.187 --> 33:43.857
Where does he get his pickup line?

458
33:43.857 --> 33:45.442
No, we haven't.

459
33:46.929 --> 33:49.118
Want me to carry that to wherever you're going?

460
33:50.049 --> 33:52.199
If you like helping people so much,

461
33:52.199 --> 33:54.462
you should be a social worker.

462
33:55.118 --> 33:56.495
Yes.

463
33:56.495 --> 33:58.833
Actually, I do a similar job.

464
33:58.833 --> 34:00.260
I see.

465
34:01.291 --> 34:02.959
I'm short on time.

466
34:02.959 --> 34:04.252
Take care.

467
34:10.121 --> 34:12.359
I'm headed that way anyway.

468
35:19.153 --> 35:20.747
Are you okay?

469
35:22.487 --> 35:25.276
You really should be a social worker.

470
35:26.543 --> 35:27.618
Sorry?

471
35:32.336 --> 35:33.921
It's me.

472
35:46.313 --> 35:48.239
This is bad.

473
36:05.290 --> 36:08.460
You look so different, I didn't even recognize you.

474
36:08.460 --> 36:11.009
Yeah, I guess.

475
36:13.214 --> 36:18.020
But why the totally different look?

476
36:21.097 --> 36:22.787
Well...

477
36:24.976 --> 36:28.068
You don't have to tell me if you don't want to.

478
36:29.527 --> 36:31.248
Thank you.

479
36:36.600 --> 36:38.152
All done.

480
36:40.404 --> 36:42.051
Just like that?

481
36:50.181 --> 36:51.837
This is perfect.

482
36:53.633 --> 36:55.719
You really are a social worker.

483
36:56.925 --> 36:58.760
I really, really appreciate it.

484
36:58.760 --> 37:00.887
- Sure. - I'm so grateful,

485
37:00.887 --> 37:03.390
but I'm really short on time.

486
37:05.060 --> 37:07.661
Good karma's coming your way!

487
37:07.661 --> 37:09.145
Bye!

488
37:09.145 --> 37:12.580
Wait...

489
37:15.106 --> 37:17.026
What an interesting person.

490
37:18.238 --> 37:20.150
So if you look here...

491
37:20.150 --> 37:23.570
Why don't we take a short break?

492
37:25.170 --> 37:27.548
If you take a look at the...

493
37:33.956 --> 37:36.605
[Nurimaro Unity Festival]

494
38:02.574 --> 38:06.453
When is this damn meeting ever going to end?

495
38:12.167 --> 38:14.932
Hello! We're India Red.

496
38:22.093 --> 38:24.512
Here's our second song.

497
40:28.713 --> 40:32.665
Ugh, and I can't even go to the after-party on a day like this.

498
40:34.669 --> 40:36.418
That guy...

499
40:36.418 --> 40:38.587
is he really a social worker?

500
40:46.821 --> 40:49.532
Not slacking off, I hope.

501
40:49.532 --> 40:52.118
He's a mind reader.

502
40:52.118 --> 40:53.987
As if that would scare me.

503
40:56.670 --> 40:59.377
I'm working myself to pieces.

504
41:02.347 --> 41:04.851
Worked yourself into dust, then?

505
41:04.851 --> 41:07.592
Is that why I can't see you anywhere?

506
41:07.592 --> 41:10.011
No way, is he back already?

507
41:11.012 --> 41:13.585
He said he'd be back at 8:30!

508
41:21.044 --> 41:23.235
I still have three stops left!

509
41:26.444 --> 41:28.571
Don't panic, Eun Chae.

510
41:28.571 --> 41:30.416
I have an alibi.

511
41:34.327 --> 41:36.478
I'll be back after dinner!

512
41:39.695 --> 41:42.210
I'm having dinner. I'll be back soon.

513
41:44.955 --> 41:46.956
Eating where?

514
41:48.844 --> 41:50.969
Oh, forget it.

515
41:50.969 --> 41:54.055
At least let me ride in peace on the way.

516
42:01.896 --> 42:03.648
Heading to the office?

517
42:03.648 --> 42:05.108
Yes.

518
42:05.108 --> 42:06.887
The chairman summoned me.

519
42:08.111 --> 42:09.654
Better go report to him.

520
42:09.654 --> 42:11.990
On how Kwon Do Hyeok did today.

521
42:11.990 --> 42:13.616
It's sushi.

522
42:13.616 --> 42:15.910
You barely ate earlier.

523
42:15.910 --> 42:17.412
No need.

524
42:17.412 --> 42:20.331
Then please give it to Eun Chae.

525
42:20.331 --> 42:21.916
I'm sure she'd love it.

526
42:21.916 --> 42:25.837
Why would I do anything to make that woman happy?

527
42:25.837 --> 42:28.298
When you do someone a kindness,

528
42:28.298 --> 42:30.425
do it the way Santa Claus would.

529
42:55.195 --> 42:56.794
The bouquet!

530
42:56.794 --> 42:58.696
I'll just take it.

531
43:09.130 --> 43:11.032
What the heck!

532
43:14.302 --> 43:16.556
And he wasn't even here...

533
43:18.014 --> 43:19.935
Look who's talking!

534
43:23.535 --> 43:27.190
Looks like you've been playing yourself to pieces.

535
43:29.609 --> 43:32.195
I left a note.

536
43:32.195 --> 43:34.614
Saying I'd be back after dinner.

537
43:44.264 --> 43:45.625
What did you eat?

538
43:45.625 --> 43:49.212
Do I have to report that, too?

539
43:49.212 --> 43:52.173
Where did those flowers come from?

540
43:54.217 --> 43:56.697
I found them on the ground.

541
44:07.021 --> 44:09.107
What are you doing?

542
44:09.107 --> 44:10.900
Why would you throw out

543
44:10.900 --> 44:12.944
someone else's bouquet like that!

544
44:12.944 --> 44:15.822
You brought trash into my office.

545
44:15.822 --> 44:18.366
They're pretty, so how is that trash?

546
44:18.366 --> 44:21.697
Didn't you just say you found them on the ground?

547
44:21.697 --> 44:23.246
Exactly!

548
44:23.246 --> 44:26.635
Some man suddenly tossed them to me,

549
44:26.635 --> 44:28.230
and I picked them up, that's all.

550
44:28.230 --> 44:33.548
So, some man threw flowers at you while you were eating?

551
44:33.548 --> 44:35.324
I know, right?

552
44:49.557 --> 44:52.900
I won't have trash like that in my office.

553
44:52.900 --> 44:55.403
- Throw it out. - This is my desk.

554
44:55.403 --> 44:57.405
That desk is company property!

555
44:57.405 --> 44:59.082
How petty!

556
45:00.450 --> 45:02.285
Don't you dare touch it.

557
45:02.285 --> 45:05.037
Touching other people's things is...

558
45:05.037 --> 45:06.511
What's the crime called?

559
45:06.511 --> 45:08.176
What is it called!

560
45:08.176 --> 45:09.208
What?

561
45:09.208 --> 45:11.294
Misappropriation of lost property?

562
45:11.294 --> 45:13.129
Right. That one!

563
45:13.129 --> 45:14.714
That's it!

564
45:14.714 --> 45:15.715
Enough.

565
45:15.715 --> 45:18.458
Did you finish everything I told you to do?

566
45:22.722 --> 45:24.891
Guess not.

567
45:24.891 --> 45:26.017
Then get to it.

568
45:26.017 --> 45:28.144
I'm going to eat,

569
45:28.144 --> 45:30.897
and since you already ate,

570
45:30.897 --> 45:32.516
you're good, right?

571
45:35.064 --> 45:37.191
I don't care, whatever.

572
46:01.406 --> 46:02.938
Is that...

573
46:02.938 --> 46:04.555
sushi?

574
46:04.555 --> 46:06.390
It's sushi.

575
46:08.309 --> 46:11.896
It's a lot for one person, though.

576
46:18.110 --> 46:20.705
But you did say you'd eaten.

577
46:27.161 --> 46:29.107
The fish is fresh.

578
46:51.018 --> 46:53.794
So, sushi...

579
46:54.480 --> 46:55.566
do you like it?

580
46:55.566 --> 46:58.263
If you don't, pass it to me.

581
47:00.272 --> 47:01.892
It's just food.

582
47:03.447 --> 47:05.449
Just food?

583
47:05.449 --> 47:08.815
If sushi's "just food" to you, hand it over.

584
47:13.245 --> 47:16.290
I do like sushi, though...

585
47:17.441 --> 47:18.893
I didn't ask.

586
47:20.711 --> 47:23.645
Then what food do you like?

587
47:24.635 --> 47:26.708
I've never thought about that.

588
47:27.703 --> 47:30.539
Clean this up for me.

589
47:44.113 --> 47:45.803
Shall I...

590
47:45.803 --> 47:48.130
clean it up?

591
47:54.779 --> 47:56.231
Oh, my.

592
47:57.168 --> 48:00.755
It's tuna and flounder belly!

593
48:03.888 --> 48:04.925
I can't help it.

594
48:04.925 --> 48:06.692
I'm hungry.

595
48:16.901 --> 48:18.472
It's so good.

596
48:24.375 --> 48:27.075
Didn't you say you'd eaten dinner?

597
48:27.742 --> 48:31.035
If you leave food, you have to eat it all in heaven.

598
48:31.035 --> 48:34.914
So I forced myself to eat it even though I'm full.

599
48:36.195 --> 48:37.958
Good job.

600
48:37.958 --> 48:39.493
Well done.

601
48:40.252 --> 48:42.017
Heaven sounds nice.

602
48:51.002 --> 48:52.988
Whatever.

603
49:02.647 --> 49:04.825
It's already past 11.

604
49:08.515 --> 49:10.282
This guy won't even go home.

605
49:10.282 --> 49:11.534
What is he doing?

606
49:40.146 --> 49:44.275
When the CEO is in the lab, never, ever disturb him.

607
49:44.956 --> 49:47.175
What is he doing in there?

608
49:49.238 --> 49:51.312
That sex addict.

609
49:52.158 --> 49:54.152
Is he watching something dirty?

610
50:26.166 --> 50:29.069
Why is it so firm?

611
50:33.032 --> 50:36.015
Why is my heart pounding?

612
50:43.167 --> 50:44.418
What's this?

613
50:44.418 --> 50:48.297
What on earth is this room, anyway?

614
50:48.297 --> 50:50.090
You even locked the door.

615
50:50.090 --> 50:53.621
There are things we shouldn't watch together.

616
50:53.621 --> 50:56.497
Then please finish what you were doing.

617
50:56.497 --> 50:58.933
I'm going home now.

618
50:58.933 --> 51:01.496
I have a midnight curfew.

619
51:01.496 --> 51:02.728
Curfew?

620
51:02.728 --> 51:05.189
Your lies come in all varieties.

621
51:05.189 --> 51:06.482
No, it's not a lie.

622
51:10.903 --> 51:12.578
Look.

623
51:16.534 --> 51:20.412
Dad, I'm really still at work.

624
51:20.412 --> 51:22.206
Dad.

625
51:22.206 --> 51:24.458
What an elaborate plan.

626
51:24.458 --> 51:25.668
Impressive.

627
51:30.130 --> 51:33.634
Dad, I'll put someone on to prove I'm really at work.

628
51:33.634 --> 51:36.679
This is Manager Kwon.

629
51:37.198 --> 51:38.747
Impressive.

630
51:40.188 --> 51:43.686
Oh my, Manager Kwon, is it?

631
51:43.686 --> 51:48.190
Yes, I'm Eun Chae's father.

632
51:50.943 --> 51:52.862
Yes...

633
51:52.862 --> 51:55.450
Taeyun Group marketing!

634
51:55.450 --> 51:58.450
You must be so busy,

635
51:58.450 --> 52:00.286
but...

636
52:00.286 --> 52:05.583
it's not like we only live for today.

637
52:05.583 --> 52:11.171
Your company must have rules that employees have to follow.

638
52:11.171 --> 52:15.944
I also have something I want my child to follow,

639
52:15.944 --> 52:18.596
and that's a curfew.

640
52:18.596 --> 52:19.597
Yes.

641
52:19.597 --> 52:22.151
As it happens, we were about to leave now.

642
52:22.151 --> 52:25.769
As you know, it's a rough world out there.

643
52:25.769 --> 52:27.749
I'm sure you understand.

644
52:27.749 --> 52:28.898
Yes.

645
52:28.898 --> 52:33.694
I'll see your daughter home on my way.

646
52:36.901 --> 52:40.029
That's new from you.

647
52:41.327 --> 52:42.953
No need.

648
52:42.953 --> 52:44.766
I can go home by myself.

649
52:44.766 --> 52:46.749
I made a promise to your father.

650
52:46.749 --> 52:49.540
If I don't keep it, that makes me a liar.

651
52:49.540 --> 52:52.085
I can't stand that.

652
52:57.616 --> 53:01.107
What happens if you miss your curfew?

653
53:01.107 --> 53:02.723
My head gets shaved.

654
53:02.723 --> 53:03.891
Oh, come on.

655
53:03.891 --> 53:06.477
Right? Everyone says that.

656
53:06.477 --> 53:08.771
That's because they don't know my father.

657
53:08.771 --> 53:10.648
With such a scary father,

658
53:10.648 --> 53:13.300
why lie about working at Taeyun Group?

659
53:13.300 --> 53:15.893
That was a white lie.

660
53:16.641 --> 53:19.073
Never told one, have you?

661
53:19.073 --> 53:21.617
It just turned out that way.

662
53:21.617 --> 53:25.056
But with a company like ours, couldn't you just be honest?

663
53:25.056 --> 53:26.747
Forget it.

664
53:26.747 --> 53:29.333
Who knows what happens after three months.

665
53:29.333 --> 53:33.462
Maybe once I'm a real full-timer at a big company.

666
53:33.462 --> 53:37.466
Are big companies and full-time jobs that important?

667
53:37.466 --> 53:42.096
Someone like you, who was born on third base, wouldn't know.

668
53:42.096 --> 53:46.470
For us to even reach first, we have to bunt.

669
53:56.238 --> 53:59.045
The light's still on.

670
53:59.045 --> 54:00.406
Your father?

671
54:00.406 --> 54:02.741
Yes, go before we get caught...

672
54:07.705 --> 54:10.425
- What's going on? - My father's right there!

673
54:30.079 --> 54:31.779
Coast is clear.

674
54:42.322 --> 54:45.035
What, what's wrong?

675
54:45.035 --> 54:46.910
A cramp... a cramp...

676
54:46.910 --> 54:48.245
I have a cramp.

677
54:48.245 --> 54:49.663
Yeah, a cramp, okay.

678
54:49.663 --> 54:51.248
Hand, hand! Let go,

679
54:51.248 --> 54:52.916
let go of my hand!

680
54:52.916 --> 54:54.609
Sorry!

681
54:56.451 --> 54:58.953
Hand, hand, hand!

682
55:04.442 --> 55:06.529
Ouch, ouch!

683
55:13.562 --> 55:15.522
What are you doing?

684
55:15.522 --> 55:17.316
You said you had a cramp!

685
55:17.316 --> 55:18.358
Stop it!

686
55:18.358 --> 55:19.943
Just hold still!

687
55:19.943 --> 55:21.637
I'm trying to help.

688
55:37.708 --> 55:43.103
I'm just letting him hold my foot for a moment.

689
55:43.926 --> 55:47.355
I'm only doing this in case she can't walk.

690
56:00.097 --> 56:02.790
What's with the mood all of a sudden?

691
56:03.534 --> 56:05.383
Don't tell me...

692
56:53.745 --> 56:55.247
- Oh, my! - First time?

693
56:55.247 --> 56:55.956
No?

694
56:55.956 --> 56:58.356
I've had about a truckload.

695
56:58.356 --> 57:00.878
Nervous? Not like you, Lee Eun Chae.

696
57:00.878 --> 57:03.380
Guess all you have is a sex drive.

697
57:03.380 --> 57:05.591
It's my first time showing.

698
57:05.591 --> 57:07.885
You do have people you're close to, right?

699
57:07.885 --> 57:08.969
You.

700
57:08.969 --> 57:11.388
Think I'd fall for this?

701
57:11.388 --> 57:14.641
If that's acting, it deserves an award.

702
57:14.641 --> 57:16.894
He is good-looking, though.

703
57:16.894 --> 57:18.687
Don't mind what others think.

704
57:18.687 --> 57:20.291
You'll need the power of love.
